	"Name": "Farmer Portraits for 1.6",
	"Author": "mistyspring",
	"Description": "[size=3]Updated version of Aedenthorn's [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/11398]Farmer Portraits[/url][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/10855]\n<br />\n<br />[/url]With this mod, a portrait for the player can be shown on the left side of dialogue boxes in customizable situations.\n<br />\n<br />[/size][list]\n<br />[*][size=3]To create a portrait for the mod, see the original mod's [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/11398]description[/url]\uFEFF[/size]\n<br />[*][size=3]Due to Aedenthorn's retirement from the SDV Modding Community, this work is being redistributed with proper permissions.\u00A0[/size]\n<br />[/list][size=3]\n<br />\n<br />Compatible with 1.6. The mod's source code is [url=https://github.com/aedenthorn/StardewValleyMods]here[/url].\n<br />\n<br />Also check out [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/21226]Salty's ESWF content pack[/url]! (Emotions, Seasons,[size=3] Weather,[/size] and Festivals)\n<br />\n<br />[/size][size=4][b][u]\n<br />FOR MOD AUTHORS:[/u][/b][/size][size=3]\n<br />\n<br />To update your pack, change the unique ID [i]only[/i] in dependencies or HasMod\n<br />For example, if your patch looked like this:[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[code]\uFEFF{\n<br />   \uFEFF\"Action\": \"Load\",\n<br />   \uFEFF\"Target\":\"aedenthorn.FarmerPortraits/portrait\",\n<br />   \uFEFF\"FromFile\": \"assets/portrait.png\",\n<br />   \uFEFF\"When\": {\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFF\"HasMod\": \"\uFEFFaedenthorn.FarmerPortraits\"\n<br />   \uFEFF}\n<br />},\n<br />[/code]\n<br />[size=4]\n<br />Change it to this:[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[code]\uFEFF{\n<br />   \uFEFF\"Action\": \"Load\",\n<br />   \uFEFF\"Target\":\"aedenthorn.FarmerPortraits/portrait\",\n<br />   \uFEFF\"FromFile\": \"assets/portrait.png\",\n<br />   \uFEFF\"When\": {\n<br />   \uFEFF   \uFEFF\"HasMod\": \"mistyspring.\uFEFFaedenthornFarmerPortraits\"\n<br />   \uFEFF}\n<br />},\n<br />[/code]",
